            "review_title": "Review at Table Star - Hanoi",
            "review_text": "minhphuong_27\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nIs there anything you don't want to try now?\nNov 2023 • Friends\nEven though I'm not a fan of European food, when I tried pizza and pasta at home, it was quite delicious. My friend who went with me appreciated the harmonious combination of Italian, Vietnamese, and Korean flavors because Italian food has a Korean owner, so when we return to Vietnam, there is a random combination in each dish. The price is affordable, the space is light, so if you have time to go to Lotte Mall, remember to try it\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 17, 2023",
